window.products.push({"id":472203,"name":"GAIAMADE Set of 3 Coconut Wooden Plates, Ideal gift for Special Occasions, Natural Wood Plate Set for Dessert, Salad, Appetizer Plates, Fruits and Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-OiPcKtKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUITABLE FOR EVERY OCCASION. The natural dinner plate set comes in different sizes and styles. The deep brown hue and charming grain adds a warm, rich touch to any dinning table such as parties, events, get-togethers, holiday gatherings, both indoor and outdoor. Ideal kitchen gifts on Christmas, birthday, housewarming, wedding, or other holidays. GENERAL DIMENSIONS. Family Set: 7.09x7.09x2.36 in. Ideal for served as salad plates, dinner plates, dessert plates, decorations. UNIQUE AND ELEGANT DESIGNS. Our coconut plates come with variety of different shapes and designs for you to choose from, inspirited by nature, the ocean, and love. Three main themes of our dish set are Tropical, Ocean, and Family, so you can choose one that fits your personality adding an elegant and classy to your table setting. EASY TO CLEAN AND CARE. Hand washes the small plates with soapy water and air dry. To maintain a clean and shiny appearance, polish the wood plates with cooking oil to endure the longevity of the products. DO NOT use in microwave and dishwasher. Avoiding exposure to sunlight for a long time. PROUDLY MADE IN VIETNAM. We hand-craft each of our plates with care and passion by Vietnamese artisans, using 100% eco-friendly and durable coconut wood. Each dish has its own uniqueness and is hard to replicate—and that's what makes them so special.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-OiPcKtKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAIAMADE","source_asin":"B0B6BMF9HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6BMF9HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6BMF9HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
