window.products.push({"id":472416,"name":"Large Storage Bags, 8 Pack Clothes Storage Bins Foldable Closet Organizers Storage Containers with Durable Handles Thick Fabric for Blanket Comforter ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LG0lwXYuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have trouble searching for something to store your comforters, blankets, pillows, jackets or other clothes? We will provide the Perfect Large Capacity Clothes Storage Bags to meet your requirements. Our Advantages √ EXTRA LARGE CAPACITY 1.Each storage bag measures 23 x 16 x 13in (60 x 45 x 35 cm). The capacity of each organizer has enough space! 2. It is spacious enough to hold comforters, blankets, pillows, plush toys, jackets and other heavy clothing. √ STURDY REINFORCED HANDLES This storage bags with three layers of thick fabric, the handles on this storage organizer have double the load-bearing capacity of weaker, single layer handles. Their reinforced seams provide added strength that lift and secure even the bulkiest contents. The handles can withstand loads of approximately 11 lbs, so you can transport your containers worry-free. √ SECURE PROTECTIVE MATERIALS Our foldable storage bag is made from high-quality, odorless, three-ply composite non-woven fabric which simultaneously allows for ventilation and protects your stored articles from moisture and dust. Keep an eye on your stored goods through the clear window on the front of the organizer. √ VERSATILITY The storage bags set can be used for closet or under the bed. It is suitable for dormitory, attic, basement and bedroom use. Also, the foldable design allows it to be easily stored when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LG0lwXYuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Budding Joy","source_asin":"B0BTBQZDXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTBQZDXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTBQZDXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":472417,"name":"JoyJolt 8” Chef Knife, High Carbon x50 German Steel Kitchen Knife – Magnetic Gift Box.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rzOQW0D8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UTILE WITH STYLE: Our chef knives and knife sets might not be forged in fire, but they ARE fully forged and full tang. So they’re strong, long lasting and with the heft and balance you expect on any professional chefs knife. With waterproof Pakkawood handles that also match your own kitchen stuff! CAN YOU IMAGINE CHOPPING WITH THIS?: Your new sleek 8 inch Chef Knife has a 5.2” curved ergonomic handle - saving your forefinger and in balance with your slick 2.1mm blade. The heel is sleek, and the bolster is gradual - tending more towards a Japanese style chef knife. Sharp, weighing 7.4oz. TOUGH: High Carbon x50CrMoV15 German Steel (56 HRC) - perhaps your best chance at a knife with good edge retention at a reasonable price. With chromium for added corrosion resistance, and full tang triple riveted handle, it’s a durable dishwasher safe knife – remember to dry it well! MORE KNIVES, MORE CREATIONS: There’s no way you can serve an exquisite Caprese Salad without having the right tomato knife that lets you work in harmony with your juicy red friend. Expand your knife set with more sharp, sleek professional JoyJolt knives and expand how you create and serve food! LUXURY MAGNETIC GIFT BOX: This professional chef knife will arrive beautifully and securely gift boxed - with magnetic closure - complete with our robust 12-Month Warranty for gifting. Easy to use, easy to clean and easy to love! Also makes chopping potatoes easy, too! Chop With Joy, and JoyJolt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rzOQW0D8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B09YDKJP4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YDKJP4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YDKJP4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
