window.products.push({"id":472442,"name":"Pepeli Home Products Stuffed Animal Hammock Large with Lights, Hammock for Stuffed Animals, Toy Net for Stuffed Animals, Stuffed Animal Net or Hammock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MmmResjzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Macrame Toy Hammock for Stuffed Animals Give Plush Toys The Perfect Home It all began with one plushie. Then one became two. Two became ten. Ten became a room so stuffed with stuffed toys that you can’t walk without tripping, and squashing your stuffies. PepeLi handmade macrame plush hammock - clever storage done beautifully. It hangs in a corner of the room, allowing you to store tens of toys while still allowing you to get a glimpse of all the adorableness. So, whether you’re a collector that can’t get enough of cuddly plushies. A parent looking to tame the stuffie wilderness that is your kiddo’s room. Or just a neat freak that appreciates smart storage, this stuff animal organizer will be a game changer. Product Specifications: ● Color: Beige ● Materials: 4mm Cord (100% Cotton & 30% Polyester), Metal Hooks and Wood Beads ● Dimensions: 42\" x 42\" x 51\" Inches Package Inclusions: ● 3x Metal Hooks with anchors ● 1x Macrame Toy Hammock for Stuffed Animals ● 1x Battery Operated Lights (Batteries Not Included) ● 1x Bag Discover the PepeLi Difference, we went for 4mm cotton and a handcrafted, decor-elevating macrame design. You’ll dote on the boho-chic look with its eye-catching fringes and beautiful wooden beads. You’ll love the extra-durable rope that doesn’t rip or snag like regular netting tends to do. With this combination of form and functionality comes versatility. Want a way to store pillows and blankets? A stylish storage solution for all your children’s soccer and basketballs? Get an extra macrame hammock and enjoy ogle-worthy organization. Hammock for Stuffed Animals - Handmade Hanging Stuffed Animal Storage Hammock - Durable Cotton Toy Net With Metal Rings and Hanging Hooks and Lights- Boho Chic Stuff Animal Organizer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MmmResjzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PepeLi Home Products","source_asin":"B0B51ZT2D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B51ZT2D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B51ZT2D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
