window.products.push({"id":472449,"name":"IPKIG Sleeper Chair Bed, 3-in-1 Convertible Sofa Bed, Multi-Function Pull Out Sleeper Chair Upholstered Guest Bed with Pillow and Adjustable Backrest ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KO+vsxE4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Pull Out Sleeper Chair】Equipped with 4 casters and a pull handle, this single chair beds sleeper can be quickly transformed into 3 forms: sofa chair, lounger and beds. Allowing you to accommodate guests for the night, meet all your needs to the greatest extent. In addition, it can also help you save money and space. Convertible Chairs into Beds. Chair Dimensions: 26.3'' x 34.2'' x 32.6''. ☕【Adjustable Backrest & Linen Fabric】The adjustable backrest of this convertible chairs into beds can be locked in place at 3 fixed levels (105°/155°/180°) which is great for watching TV, reading, or taking a nap. 3-in-1 convertible chair sleeper bed, upholstered in linen fabric with stereo lines, full and comfortable, and foam-filled polyester for an inviting feel, the frame is wood and metal ,up to 330lbs. It comes awash in a neutral hue that blends effortlessly with your color scheme. ☕【Save Space & 4 Pocket Design】Considering space and practicality of the sleeper chair, we made the size suitable for most people. Not too large or too small, just right. It could be easily put away in any corner of your house when it is not needed. The modern sofa sleeper chair has simple and stylish design, to fit your living room, dorm, apartment, bedroom or office. There are 2 pockets on each sides. you can put magazines, mobile phones, iPad and even laptops. ☕【Sleeper Chair Bed with Lumbar Plillow】 In the \"chair\" shape, it can be used as a lumbar pillow to better support your waist, and in the \"bed\" shape, it can be used as a pillow to give your neck more comfortable Experience and protect your cervical spine. It’s readily convertible chairs into beds by pulling the tab and sliding out the hidden cushion. The pillow cover for this sleeper sofa is removable and washable. ☕【Easy Assembly & Buy with Confidence】Easy assembly required, easy to store the chair and save space for unused time. Adjustable backrest guarantees extra comfort. Pull ropes and wheels can better help you realize the conversion from chair to bed. We offer one year warranty on this convertible sofa bed, the needed replacement can be sent freely within 1 year, if you have any problem, please feel free to contact our friendly customer team, they will resolve your concerns in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KO+vsxE4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPKIG","source_asin":"B0B214HNHX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B214HNHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B214HNHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
