window.products.push({"id":472463,"name":"White Ceramic Vase Set of 2 for Modern Home Decor, Boho Vase Hollow Round Matte Pampas Flower Vase Minimalist Nordic Boho Style for Wedding Dinner Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IFEk7GB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PAMPAS GRASS VASE 】: The beautifully designed Pampas grass vase is available in large and medium sizes, two different sizes of beige vases for you to choose from. The large size measures 9 \"x8\" (H x W) and the medium size measures 7.4 \"x7\" (H x W). The neck opening is 1\", which may be a little off as these are handmade white ceramic vases. You can choose the correct size for your needs. 【WHITE MODERN VASES FOR DECOR】: They are modern style bohemian vases. These pampas grass vases are perfect for modern bedroom decor, modern kitchen decor, white kitchen decor and any modern room decor. White modern vase for home decor beige decoration, can be used as a flower stand or table decoration, bookshelf decoration or dining table centerpiece, it matches with other living room decor accessories - glass vase, black vase, tall vase, or large small vase with artificial flowers. 【UNIQUE SHAPE DECORATIVE VASE】:The overall shape of this bohemian ceramic vase is hollow and round, like a doughnut, with a hollow design in the middle, very distinctive, geometric and artistic. This round vase is suitable for dried pampas grass, bunny tails, dried flowers, foam candles, palm leaves, cherry blossoms, stems, eucalyptus, bouquets; you can use it alone or with other small white vases or black vases for a dining table centerpiece decor. 【HIGH-QUALITY&SAFE MATERIAL】:Our white ceramic vase is made of pure clay fired at high temperature using traditional techniques, making it stronger and more durable. The vase surface is frosted with an elegant white finish. The middle part of the donut vase vase is hollowed out, very unique and artistic, not only a vase, but also a piece of art. You can put this vase on bookshelf, dining table, TV cabinet, coffee table, etc. 【MINIMALIST HOME DECOR & PERFECT GIFT】:These white ceramic vases for decoration is a perfect centerpiece for all rooms and occasions thanks to its simple and modern design. And the ceramic flower vase will add charm and beauty to your living space, an ideal gift for friends, family, lovers and a great choice for birthdays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IFEk7GB7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AGIRL","source_asin":"B0BGP8VBLY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGP8VBLY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGP8VBLY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
