window.products.push({"id":472785,"name":"HOME-X Red Rooster Spoon Holder, Pot/Pan Clip Kitchen Accessories, Fun Hostess Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51goOceXtxL._AC_SL1448_.jpg","description":"Need a little extra help in the kitchen? These adorable silicone farm animals are up to the task. Enjoy a combination of fun and function from these heat-resistant silicone pot clips. They add both charm and character to any kitchen where they’re used, whether in an RV, a college dorm, or a country-themed home. They hold your cooking utensil off the counter until you’re ready to use it again, minimizing the cleaning that needs to be done after you cook. We’ve all faced the same dilemma before: you’re stirring a pot of soup or a pan of meat and veggies when you need to set your greasy utensil down. Where you do put it? Don’t dirty an extra dish or get grease on your clean counters. When you’re ready to use your spoon holder, just attach it to the edge of your pot or pan, and place your messy spoon on inside. You’ll love having a designated place for your measuring spoon to sit while you chop vegetables and carry out other kitchen tasks. This spoon holder provides the best solution for keeping your mixing spoon easily accessible while eliminating stovetop messes and spills. Less cleaning means more time enjoying a home-cooked meal with family, so it’s worth the investment! These pot clips make the best gifts for cooking enthusiasts in your life, whether man, woman, or child. Give as a birthday gift, stocking stuffer, dinner party present, or just because. Your thoughtfulness will be deeply appreciated. Make cooking and dinnertime cleanup easier and faster than ever with these colorful pot clip spoon holders from Home-X.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51goOceXtxL._AC_SL1448_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07QZ3S11G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QZ3S11G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QZ3S11G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
