window.products.push({"id":472899,"name":"WHW Whole House Worlds Eternity Double Curled Wave Sculpture, Decorative Modern Art, Silver Titanium Glazed Ceramic Stoneware, 8 1/4 Inches, Abstract ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MNSypC50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Like a graceful arabesque, The Eternity Double Curl Rising Wave Sculpture is inspired by the artful spirit and endless energy found in nature. Stylized and sleek, this piece provokes contemplation while adding a stylish focal point. Crafted of hand cast silver titanium glazed stoneware, this modern piece offers energy and dimension where ever it is displayed. Well sized, this piece measures as follows: 5 L x 2 1/2 W x 8 1/4 H inches. Proportioned for homes and apartments, this contemporary piece is also wonderful for professional spaces to cast a welcoming yet modern atmosphere. Handcrafted by skilled artisans, the smooth surface of this piece brings calm and relaxing vibes to your spaces. The Eternity Double Curl Rising Wave Sculpture is ideal for gifting all year for many occasions including weddings, birthdays, anniversaries, housewarmings, holiday presents, and many more. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MNSypC50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B07NW158LP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NW158LP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NW158LP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":472900,"name":"SN Decor Artificial Pe Calla Lily 21Pcs Green Pe Calla Lily for Home Decoration Indoor and Outdoor Wedding Arrangement Bouquet Floral Centerpiece Real","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51i-C5TBbcL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Qty: 21Pcs; Size: 14\"x5\" - Materials: Soft touch like real Flowers - Made from High Quality Plastic - Vase/pot not included*** How to maintain - 1).Please avoid direct sunlight exposure over an extended time to keep the colors bright; 2) If the artificial plants become dusty after a long time, please wash them gently with water, brush, or cloth. Note: Plants may be pressed during transportation, simply sort by hands will restore the original shape. Flowers are part of special occasions, whether for Valentine’s Day, Birthday, Wedding and Anniversary. It symbolizes love and purity that is why women appreciate receiving a piece of long stem rose or bouquet of flowers with or without any celebration. But, let us be real, flowers especially the arranged ones are not so affordable. Some people find it not practical to buy something that will not even last a week. So, the best option for those who like flowers but do not want to spend too much is to get artificial flowers made of pretty materials like silk. Here are the benefits of purchasing artificial flowers: Practical and Affordable – unlike real and fresh flowers, artificial ones are definitely cost-effective. Since you can keep it for a long time especially if it serves as a display at home, you can save money instead of replacing it over and over. It is practical because you are not wasting anything not even a single cent. Safe and Hypo-allergenic – some people are allergic to pollens and that makes them want to stay away from any kind of flower. It causes them hay fever or rhinitis. Artificial flower is suitable for them since it does not contain any allergen. Eco-friendly – obviously, in artificial flowers, you are not doing any harm to the environment and living things around us. If you are a nature-lover, then you must consider the artificial ones instead of picking or cutting plants and flowers. Easy to maintain – plastic or silk flowers are easy to clean and arrange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51i-C5TBbcL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SN Decor","source_asin":"B08931HBN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08931HBN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08931HBN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
