window.products.push({"id":472916,"name":"North HOMECalifornia King Sheet Set,Dark Blue 100% Egyptian Cotton Extra Soft,Luxury Breathable Easy Fit Cozy Warm and Deep Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LaF1VR7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL: Our bed shees made from egyptian cotton and a lustrous sateen finish which is strength and durability. These silky soft cotton quality sheets are breathable to keep you cool in the summer and cozy during winters for ultimate comfort all year-around. DETAIL DESIGN: The bottom fitted sheet has an all-round \"gripper\" elastic design which will let it stays in its place and doesn’t come off. The all-over solid design of these sheets sets, which are available in a variety of colors, complements modern and traditional décor offering year-round comfort. WHAT IS IN THIS SET: California King Size Luxury 4pc Bed Sheets Set - 1 Flat Sheet: 110\" x 102\"; 1 Fully Elasticized Fitted Sheet: 72\" x 84\" + 16\" finished deep pocket to fit mattresses upto 16\"; and 2 Standard Pillowcase: 20\" x 40\". This sheet set gets softer and resists fading with every wash, making it completely worth the money. ECO FRIENDLY SHEETS: All our dyes, auxiliaries, and our bedding sets are OEKO-TEX certified to ensure your safety. According to the guidelines, these products are tested for harmful substances and produced in an environmentally friendly and socially responsible manner. Each fabric batch is also tested for various durability features such as no-pilling, low shrinkage, color fastness etc., then stitched, individually inspected to be defect free and finally packed for sales EASY CARE AND MAINTENANCE: Each sheet set is independently tested for anti-pilling, shrink-resistance, and fade-resistance. To avoid shrinkage and prevent wrinkles, we recommend machine washing the sheets at room temperature, tumble dry them on low, and folding them immediately after.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LaF1VR7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORTH HOME","source_asin":"B08SJGFWS5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJGFWS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJGFWS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
