window.products.push({"id":472919,"name":"SKG Slow Masticating Juicer Cold Press 36 RPM Big Mouth Juice Extractor,White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vxrxBbGWL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"WIDE 3.15” TURN OVER CHUTE –The A10’s flip over 3.15” (80mm) opening allows for large fruits and vegetables to enter the appliance easily. The A10 also has a 1.75” (45mm) opening which is meant for longer produce. The two openings are designed so produce can easily enter the juicer. BETTER TASTING AND MORE NUTRITIOUS JUICE – Using a slow masticating juicer like the SKG Large Caliber Juicer rather than a centrifugal juicer prevents the rapid oxidation which can be caused by the high-speed spinning of a centrifugal juicer. The powerful 250W AC motor’s slow speed allows each and every piece of produce enough time to have its juice fully extracted, leaving behind only dry pulp and delicious and nutritious juice. MORE JUICE FOR PULP LOVERS AND HATERS ALIKE - The SKG Large Caliber Juicer produces more juice than its competitors (Orange 70%, Pear 81.3%, Apple 78%, Celery 80.5%, Carrot 55%). Both a fine strainer (for purer juice) and a rough strainer (for juice with more pulp) are included for your juicing needs. An innovative second filter further strains out foam and pulp. EASY ASSEMBLY AND DISASSEMBLY, CONVENIENT CLEAN UP – Setting up this juicer takes only a few simple steps unlike many of its competitors. Taking it apart takes even less time and each piece is designed to provide a fast and efficient cleaning process. This juicer have two directions switch: \"Forward\" is used to turn on the machine and start juicing, while \"Reverse\" switch make the motor spin on opposite direction to release the material after juicing, which help to clean the machine easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vxrxBbGWL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKG","source_asin":"B07YXJ93YQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-472919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YXJ93YQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YXJ93YQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
